    "ciesin:category": "Infrastructure",
    "ciesin:tags": "GRID3",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7916/kv1n-0743",
    "ciesin:purpose": "The GRID3 NGA - Health Facilities v2.0 dataset is a non-exhaustive, non-validated geographic representation of health facility points in Nigeria. The dataset incorporates recent updates from both the Nigeria Health Facility Registry (HFR) and GRID3. This dataset is considered operational.",
